ember that it planned to keep rates near zero at least as long as the unemployment rate remained above 6.5 percent, provided that inflation did not climb too high.\", \"passage_polarity\": \"neutral\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"The committee debated but did not resolve whether to retreat\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [7, 30]}, {\"signal_text\": \"which may be less effective in stimulating the economy\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [6, 30]}, {\"signal_text\": \"provided that inflation did not climb too high\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [7, 30]}]}, {\"passage_text\": \"For the first time, Fed officials also acknowledged that the leadership transition was complicating these decisions because investors may doubt the Fed's declarations will hold in coming years. As many as four of the seven members of the Fed's board, and two presidents of regional reserve banks, may be replaced in the next year.\", \"passage_polarity\": \"negative\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"Fed officials also acknowledged that the leadership transition was complicating these decisions\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [8, 30]}, {\"signal_text\": \"investors may doubt the Fed's declarations will hold in coming years\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [12, 23]}]}]}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 18175, "total_tokens": 19871, "completion_tokens": 1696, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "elapsed": 221.78594136238098, "outlet": "['nytimes']", "article_source": "https://www.nytimes.com/2013/10/10/business/economy/fed-minutes-show-deepening-divide.html", "pr_company": "federalreserve.gov", "judgement": 1, "press_release_id": 20058, "article_id": 197209}
