 Walt Disney and/or Marvel has taken, which is to basically say \\\"We got the girl market covered with Disney princesses, so we don't need girls to buy Marvel merchandise.\\\" And I will absolutely admit that there are plenty of girls, including my daughter, who will probably be into this line-up partially because of the (stereotypically) girl-centric push.\", \"passage_polarity\": \"mixed\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"happy that Warner Bros. and company have made what looks to be a big and splashy effort to sell their superhero universe to girls\", \"signal_type\": \"praise\", \"polarity\": \"positive\", \"rubric_matches\": [15, 59]}, {\"signal_text\": \"better than the attitude that Walt Disney and/or Marvel has taken\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"positive\", \"rubric_matches\": [15, 59]}, {\"signal_text\": \"(stereotypically) girl-centric push\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [46, 132]}]}, {\"passage_text\": \"But nonetheless, I wish the powers-that-be had merely made a consciousness choice to just make more female-skewing merchandise out of their already popular female superheroes. Girls don't need pink-colored and romance-skewing \\\" Rebelles\\\" bow-and-arrow toys , they just need to be assured that it's okay for them to want to pick up the same bow-and-arrow that their brothers or fathers play with.\", \"passage_polarity\": \"negative\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"wish the powers-that-be had merely made a consciousness choice to just make more female-skewing merchandise out of their already popular female superheroes\", \"signal_type\": \"suggestion\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [47, 59]}, {\"signal_text\": \"Girls don't need pink-colored and romance-skewing \\\" Rebelles\\\" bow-and-arrow toys\", \"signal_type\": \"complaint\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [46, 132]}, {\"signal_text\": \"they just need to be assured that it's okay 