xt": "And the company is able to bolster its balance sheet", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "positive", "rubric_matches": [116, 200], "_snap_kind": "no_match"}, {"signal_text": "With the latest funding round, Faire has now raised over $1.4 billion since its 2017 inception", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "positive", "rubric_matches": [116, 199], "_snap_kind": "no_match"}, {"signal_text": "Faire's model is interesting in that it aims to be an indie Amazon, if you will", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "neutral", "rubric_matches": [66, 166], "_snap_kind": "no_match"}, {"signal_text": "It connects emerging independent businesses around the world with local retailers so that their goods can be sold to more people", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "positive", "rubric_matches": [15, 59], "_snap_kind": "no_match"}, {"signal_text": "In mid-November, when it announced its last raise, Faire said that it saw 'more than 3x year-on-year growth' and had reached more than $1 billion in annual volume in less than five years", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "neutral", "rubric_matches": [2, 116], "_snap_kind": "no_match"}, {"signal_text": "That same month, Faire noted that six months after it expanded into 15 markets in Europe and the United Kingdom, its annualized sales volume in the region exceeded more than $150 million -- 'a scale that took nearly three years to achieve in North America,' it said", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "neutral", "rubric_matches": [2, 116], "_snap_kind": "no_match"}, {"signal_text": "According to its website, its marketplace connects over 450,000 retailers globally to more than 70,000 brands from over 100 countries", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "neutral", "rubric_matches": [2, 116], "_snap_kind": "no_match"}, {"signal_text": "Extension rounds help some startups play offense during COVID-19", "signal_type": "observation", "polarity": "neutral", "rubric_matches": [50, 66], "_sna