laint", "polarity": "negative", "rubric_matches": [10, 27], "_snap_kind": "exact"}, {"signal_text": "Now a hamstrung F.C.C. is in even worse shape to deal with agile scammers", "signal_type": "complaint", "polarity": "negative", "rubric_matches": [10, 27], "_snap_kind": "exact"}], "_snap_kind": "exact"}]}, "raw_text": "{\"unit_id\": \"pair_44738_451063\", \"passages\": [{\"passage_text\": \"But will that be enough to end the onslaught of robocalls we all live with today?The earliest iteration of the technology, which isn't all that different from what we're about to get, was introduced in 2006.\", \"passage_polarity\": \"negative\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"But will that be enough to end the onslaught of robocalls we all live with today?\", \"signal_type\": \"complaint\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [32, 71]}, {\"signal_text\": \"The earliest iteration of the technology, which isn't all that different from what we're about to get, was introduced in 2006\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [66, 70]}]}, {\"passage_text\": \"While robocalls were getting worse and worse, the Federal Communications Commission -- a government agency that is supposed to protect consumers where communications networks are concerned -- was being kneecapped by a movement toward deregulation playing out in the courts and eventually within the F.C.C. itself.\", \"passage_polarity\": \"negative\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"was being kneecapped by a movement toward deregulation\", \"signal_type\": \"complaint\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [10, 27]}, {\"signal_text\": \"a government agency that is supposed to protect consumers\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"neutral\", \"rubric_matches\": [14, 45]}]}, {\"passage_text\": \"\\\"We're at least five years short of where we should be,\\\" said Henning Schulzrinne, who was chief technology officer of the F.C.C. during the Obama