nal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [34, 51]}]}, {\"passage_text\": \"But there's no guarantee the telecom companies will continue to fight the scammers as their shady tactics evolve. Phone calls are not the lucrative part of the current array of services the telecom companies offer and are dirt cheap to boot. Telecoms don't lose much (if any) money on the fire hose of seconds-long spam calls that proliferate. Why invest a lot of resources in blocking them instead of, say, developing 5G networks?\", \"passage_polarity\": \"negative\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"But there's no guarantee the telecom companies will continue to fight the scammers\", \"signal_type\": \"complaint\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [16, 31]}, {\"signal_text\": \"Telecoms don't lose much (if any) money on the fire hose of seconds-long spam calls\", \"signal_type\": \"observation\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [15, 16]}, {\"signal_text\": \"Why invest a lot of resources in blocking them instead of, say, developing 5G networks?\", \"signal_type\": \"complaint\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [15, 16]}]}, {\"passage_text\": \"Regulatory agencies exist to protect consumers when economic incentives fail them. Although communications czars under the Obama administration were less averse to regulation, even they did not do enough to stop the robocall scourge. Now a hamstrung F.C.C. is in even worse shape to deal with agile scammers armed to the teeth with technologies that enable them to exploit and torment consumers.\", \"passage_polarity\": \"negative\", \"signals\": [{\"signal_text\": \"even they did not do enough to stop the robocall scourge\", \"signal_type\": \"complaint\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [10, 27]}, {\"signal_text\": \"Now a hamstrung F.C.C. is in even worse shape to deal with agile scammers\", \"signal_type\": \"complaint\", \"polarity\": \"negative\", \"rubric_matches\": [10, 27]}]}]}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 19351, "total_tokens": 20728, "completion_tokens": 1377, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "elapsed": 258.87035179138184, "outlet": "['nytimes']", "article_source": "nytimes", "pr_company": "about_att", "judgement": 1, "press_release_id": 44738, "article_id": 451063}
